      "instance_name": "visual_expression",
      "label": "Visual Expression: Skeptical, Questioning Expression",
      "description": "The woman's facial expression and posture are used to convey a sense of weary resignation or mock confusion. This visual cue is culturally understood as a form of non-verbal communication that complements the text. The meme's effectiveness relies on the viewer recognizing this expression as a common way to express exasperation or sarcasm in social contexts.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
