      "instance_name": "meme_structure",
      "label": "Meme Structure: Text-Image Juxtaposition",
      "description": "The meme uses a common internet meme format where a visual image (in this case, a woman with a skeptical expression) is paired with text to create a humorous or ironic message. Understanding this structure requires knowledge of internet meme culture and how visual and textual elements are combined for comedic effect.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
